      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Look away at a plant nearby or the view outside"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "离开电脑超过一次长休息的时长，会当作已经休息过，回来后重新开始一轮。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you’re away longer than a long break, it counts as a break and a new round starts when you’re back."
